  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nOklahoma City, Oklahoma — On June 16, 2025, Oklahoma City Police responded to a call, in the 3500 block of SW 17th. As officers approached the front door of the residence, 41-year-old Eddie Hill, who was armed with a knife, opened the front door, charged and attempted to stab the closest officer to him. Hill was ordered to drop the knife but instead continued to advance on the officer while still armed with the knife, resulting in Hill being shot. Hill was transported to an area hospital where he died from his injuries.\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Wolfey Estep\n- 'HennyGod Lamier'\n- Bagpiper Joshua Agee\n- FloridaOperative\n- thomas\n- 'PrussianBlue'\n- Cody Stephens\n- Kaedyn\n- Daniel G\n- David, Guershom\n- 'K9 Kampers with Alfredo'\n- Troy Polansky\n- Tulla Belle\n- 'quadrakyiro'\n- Scott Mackin\n- \"John B. GunsSaveLife\"\n- david wallace\n- '10izshoe'\n- 'Wilcer - Crank Hustle'\n- 'DerLitti86'\n- Brice Danos\n- 'PhlyDaily'\n- Brandon M.\n- Jesse\n- Jeff Short\n- RayJayOB\n- Sean Sheldon\n- Josef Rex\n- 'Jun'\n- 'Xenik'\n- 'GotsNoGroove Cheryl'\n- James Pringle\n- Kelly Goodwin\n- 'Dawesenm'\n- 'Brother.Legal'\n- Paul Rohrbaugh\n- Zach Williams\n- Michael R Sheffield\n- Rich Biggs\n- 'AccuShoot.com'\n- Lisa Overly\n- 'Necko'\n- Gerardo Flores\n- 'coco Coco'\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nSupport us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/PoliceActivity\nFollow us on X: https://x.com/Police_Activity\n\n- Links to the Best Dash Cams you can buy.\nViofo A229 Pro 4K HDR: https://amzn.to/4dYwN2b\nGarmin Mini 3 1080p: https://amzn.to/41hmktx\nVantrue N5 2.7K: https://amzn.to/4dYxgBt\nNexar Pro 1080p: https://amzn.to/3TpyL3y\nThinkware X1000 2K: https://amzn.to/3Bby9Ij\nBlackVue DR970X 4K: https://amzn.to/3Zl7Fy3\n\n🛍️ Check out our Amazon store: https://www.amazon.com/shop/PoliceActivity 🛍️\n\nDiscl